  "_comment": [
    "A host's answers, and nothing an application is allowed to carry.",
    "",
    "This is not part of any package: a `.vapp` never contains somebody's wallet.",
    "It is what a host would hand back when a program declares what it needs —",
    "state, the credentials it holds, what a query answers — and it is one file",
    "because three places used to invent this separately: the runtime's tests,",
    "`valrun`, and the preview.",
    "",
    "Nothing here is signed. `verified` names the policy a real host would have",
    "checked before handing the credential over; this one asserts it, which is",
    "why the preview says so out loud."
